title: Opening Sequence — Docking Puzzle
story: no-signal-home
description: Tests the complete opening sequence: alarm, docking steps, quality checks. Includes EVENT and STATE assertions for key state transitions.

---

## Starting room is Tug Cargo Hold

> look
[OK: contains "Tug Cargo Hold"]
[OK: contains "alarm"]
[STATE: true, yourself.location = Tug Cargo Hold]

## Examine cargo hold items

> examine crates
[OK: contains "DEEP REACH SALVAGE"]

> examine bedroll
[OK: contains "sleeping pad"]

> examine datapad
[OK: contains "DRIFT MODE"]

## Move to cockpit

> south
[OK: contains "Tug Cockpit"]
[OK: contains "alarm"]
[STATE: true, yourself.location = Tug Cockpit]

## Can't go aft before docking

> south
[OK: contains_any "locked" "sealed" "docking"]

## Alarm button

> press button
[OK: contains "alarm"]
[OK: contains "Stillwater"]
[OK: contains "Meridian"]
[EVENT: true, type="action.success" messageId="story.alarm.silenced"]

> press button
[OK: contains "already"]

## Docking sequence — need to examine controls first

> maneuver
[OK: contains "examine"]

> examine docking controls
[OK: contains "docking"]
[OK: contains "MANEUVER"]

## Docking steps

> maneuver
[OK: contains_any "control" "thrusters" "manual"]

> fire thrusters
[OK: contains_any "brake" "decelerate" "slow"]

> extend arm
[OK: contains_any "clamp" "locked" "docking arm"]

> check pressure
[OK: contains_any "pressure" "green" "seal"]

> seal
[OK: contains_any "Green" "green" "unlocks"]

## Can now go aft to airlock

> south
[OK: contains "Airlock"]
[STATE: true, yourself.location = Airlock]

> examine inspection window
[OK: contains_any "window" "docking"]

> examine claw marks
[OK: contains_any "claw" "gouges" "scratches"]
